WEBVTT

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.120
Great! I managed to wake up early.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.630
Wow, it's sunny!

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:33.090
This should do.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.390
Yunocchi, good morning.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:40.970
Good morning, Miya. You're up early.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.810
Yup, and the weather is great.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.650
Are you going to air out your futon?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.310
No, but I've got...

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.310
These.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:48.770
Horse mackerel!

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:49.690
You dry fish there?!

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.480
They say, ''The early bird catches the worm.''

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:52.820
Horse mackerel!

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.490
So, the early mackerel should
be warm and tasty... kinda.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.120
Wow, you're hyper even in the morning.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.880
Ano ano donna iro ga ima desuka?

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.130
Egao no white

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.550
Namida no blue

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.220
Kasanete mita toki

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:24.560
Honjitsu seiten nari canvas ni

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.270
Milk no ice, ramune gokun

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.940
Genki ni color topping

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.990
Oi! ough gaki please

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:39.870
Minna no nigaoe contest

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.660
Yuno

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:47.120
Yoshi! Ato de ''pun'' okoranai de ne

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.910
Miyako

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.370
Hiro

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:54.210
Switch osaretara wa-ha-ha

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.630
Sae

00:01:54.210 --> 00:02:00.550
Nanka ii kimochi nareba ii kanji

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:02.100
Kyousou da

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.930
Ichihayaku ringo tabeyo

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.520
Sou ja nainda yo

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.190
Sou de iinda yo

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:16.110
Kudamono wa model san

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.950
Saa dessin shimasho ka

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.830
Shukudai dayo

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.370
May 18th

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.370
The Singing Shortcake

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.710
<i>I'm Ishii of the Fashion Check Taskforce.</i>

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:40.300
If school was off,
I'd have washed the sheets.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.560
But then why don't I feel like
doing it on Sunday?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.190
Oh no, it's time.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:02.910
All right, class, let's sketch outside
because the weather is so nice.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:07.040
You can sketch anything at school.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.210
But you can't step outside.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.460
What's wrong, Miya?

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.970
Right after I got up, I got carried away
and gulped down lots of milk.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.180
Are you all right?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.970
Yeah, I'm okay. It'll be gone eventually.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.100
Your body can't take milk?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.440
Usually, I'm all right, but it happens sometimes.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.690
Yunocchi, pay attention to her.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:42.410
You can use paints, but make sure you finish
your work within the class period.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.320
Excuse me. I can use anything as a motif?

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.660
Wha?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.740
Anything...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:53.120
No, not the controversial one,
like a nude person on the grass!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.130
No one would do that but you.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.170
Ms. Yoshinoya...

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.630
What's wrong?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.340
Can I go to the bathroom?

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:07.560
Sure. You don't look so good.
Are you all right?

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.430
I'm going back home.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:14.060
If you're suffering that much,
you can rest in the nurse's room.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:18.400
Actually, my apartment is closer from here.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.650
Oh...

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.150
Are you really okay?

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.900
Yeah, I feel better than earlier.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:27.280
Okay, I'll look for a motif
somewhere around here.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.910
Okay.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.830
Wow, how beautiful.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:36.040
An outdoor sketching assignment?

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.000
Have you found any interesting motifs?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.550
No, not yet.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:47.430
I'll do anything to help you. What do you
think about a principal against flowers?

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.350
Well, um...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.440
Sorry, but that sounds too difficult for me.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.400
Wow, that was unexpected.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:05.610
There are many places in the school
that I'm not familiar with yet.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:09.030
l didn't know there was a bamboo grove here.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.040
A bamboo grove...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.580
Mr. Bamboo Grove...

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.250
Please, don't tell anyone about this.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.050
Please, don't!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.170
A secret date?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.800
No!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.390
l wonder what they were doing?

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.350
A stone statue?!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.770
It's so dirty.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:46.200
Come to think, I wonder how dad is doing?
l haven't heard his voice in a while.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.910
Last time I called, he wasn't home.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.540
l wonder if he's busy?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.080
Why do I think of him even though
this looks nothing like him?

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.090
He's not dirty like this either.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.590
There you are. What are you doing, Yunocchi?

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:09.680
Oh, Miya. Sorry, did you have to look for me?
Are you feeling better?

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.050
Yeah, what are you doing with it?

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.720
Oh, this stone statue?
It was dirty, so I was cleaning it.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.770
What?!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:23.650
You'll be rewarded with tons of
gifts arriving at your place.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.320
I've gotta do something myself, too.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.280
l found something.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:37.120
Please, God, give me something.
l can be next after Yunocchi.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.370
Are you copying after a fairytale?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.040
l can't wait for my reward.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.300
Watch out!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.340
I'm sorry.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.640
What? That's Yuno and...

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.060
Sorry, Miya, are you all right?

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.270
Hiro, that's not Miya!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.060
l was just kidding. Are you all right?

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.360
That was ''very'' funny.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.860
Sae was the one who hit the ball this far.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.820
She's so lively.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.780
Sae's so strong.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.910
Are you working on an assignment?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.160
Yes, we're sketching some objects at school.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.660
Did you find ''it'' in here?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.290
Yes?

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.080
<i>Mr. Bamboo Grove</i>

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.830
Meow...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.340
Hiro, what are you doing there?

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.840
Oh, hi everyone.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.510
Staring at Yamabuki Jizo, huh?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:36.640
Do you know about this?
This is my first time seeing it.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.480
No, I only know its name.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.600
Yamabuki Jizo, because it's
at Yamabuki High?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.320
Ah, so it does have a name.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:50.780
So, if I take it to my place,
will it become Hidamari Jizo?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.950
Miya, you'll be punished.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.240
l don't think that will happen.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.200
Hey, we should get back.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:04.210
Already? She's so good.
Her serves are strong.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.750
She can easily out-power boys.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.880
It's not too absurd to say that she
has too much testosterone.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.510
It is absurd!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.390
Now, let's go.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:17.600
Okay...

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.970
You are so strong, Sae.
Do you like to cross-dress?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.480
You're so mean.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.480
Bye-bye.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.480
Well then, do you sometimes
like to cross dress?

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.650
You aren't making sense.

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.900
Bye-bye.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:31.690
Bye.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:32.570
Later.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.820
Huh? What is this?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.620
''Dear Yuno, we harvested a lot back home,
so we're sending you some.''

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:47.460
''Enjoy it with your friends at the apartments.
Love, Mom and Dad''

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:51.800
Thank you, Dad, Mom.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.880
Thank you, stone statue.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:58.800
Oh no, the mackerels I was drying
on my balcony are gone!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.970
Seriously? A stray cat did it?

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.230
That smart cat.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:07.150
Maybe ''it'' had too much stress on its neck.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.900
Miya, you can have some veggies.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.530
Oh, it's a worm.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.080
Hiro, we have some food to share.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.370
l just received some veggies from my home.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.040
What happened?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.420
Never mind. Come in.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:43.810
Soon, it will be the season of wearing camisoles,
the season of sleeveless tops...

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.060
Now, now...

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.520
What's wrong with Hiro?

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.560
What happened was, at the park while ago...

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:51.770
Please don't say any more.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.320
If you don't want to eat, let me have it.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.160
They were on sale for only 100 yen!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.450
It's complicated.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.250
It just occurred to me.
Do you want to go karaoke?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.710
I'm sure it will help Hiro.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.670
Like how?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:19.430
l heard that the latest machines show the
calories you burn for each song you sing.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.180
Hmmm, how many calories per song?

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.560
About ten kilo calories.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.480
So, I just have to sing thirty songs or so?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.400
Huh?!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.940
You only want to even it?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.240
Karaoke Kirara

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.450
It's been a while since I went to karaoke.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.080
Really?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:50.790
Hiro and I go often with my classmates.
Um, I take oolong tea.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:54.420
Like after exams. I'll have ice tea.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.920
I'll have ginger ale.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.050
Yuno, do you go often too?

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.640
She's ordering drinks. Thanks.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:09.520
Hello, this is Yuno from Room 415.
ls this the front desk?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.400
Oolong tea, ice tea...
She sounds so polite.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.150
Oolong tea, ice tea...
l guess she doesn't come very often.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.070
I'll go first.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:26.330
We're here now...
It's right there now...

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:30.910
Let's set on a journey...

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:38.260
Forget about minor things and
begin to brush up...

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.090
Way to go, Hiro.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:46.640
You seem to like karaoke.
You regularly check the hit chart.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.600
Do you come with her often?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.980
Yes, sometimes.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.270
Energy burned:

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.270
Energy burned:
8 kilo calories

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:58.280
Only eight kilo calories...
Maybe I should sing fast-paced songs.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:04.110
Sorry for hogging the mic,
but it's all for burning my evil fat.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.410
Aim for 300 kilo calories!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.830
Having free time makes me antsy...

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.000
Hiro is so devoted, but why?
Loving someone makes me antsy...

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.250
Hiro is so devoted, but why?
l wanna see all kinds of places...

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.460
What happened at the park?
Wherever it is, I wanna see...
l wanna see, I wanna see...

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:21.130
Actually, she was told something.
Wherever it is, I wanna see...
l wanna see, I wanna see...

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.260
What? What is it?

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.180
Oh no, are you confused?

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.890
A little girl came to her at the bench.
Oh no, are you confused?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:29.720
That day you told me with a smile...

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:33.640
She touched her arms and said, ''fluffy.''
That day you told me with a smile...

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.060
Fluffy?
No, I'm not, not at all...

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.650
That was shocking to her.
No, I'm not, not at all...

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:39.980
How come?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.030
Hey, I told you to keep it secret!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.610
I'm sorry.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:49.870
l didn't know, but you aren't.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:53.910
Thank you, Yuno.
Oh no, I forgot to check the calories.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:54.040
Thank you, Yuno.
Oh no, I forgot to check the calories.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.290
Please, stand by.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:13:00.960
Oh well, ten kilo calories.
Now it's Sae's turn.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:14.730
And so my love ended,
in the midst of sadness...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.770
Sae, woo-hoo!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:18.980
You're doing great.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.820
I'm sorry, I suck.
It really hurts your ears doesn't it?

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.610
You are so shy, Sae.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.530
Maybe you should sing a bit louder.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.580
Your voice is charming.
Let me hear more of it.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:31.950
Second Verse

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:37.710
Remembering the feelings I had
back then, and now...

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.960
Oh my, she's totally off-key.
l find myself crying...

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.340
l find myself crying...

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.090
I'll go to the bathroom.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.680
That Sae...

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.510
Wait, no one has cued the next song yet?

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.310
l haven't decided yet.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.060
This one only has English.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.560
Miya, those are foreign songs.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:59.060
Wha? I thought these were translated
titles of the same songs.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:00.810
ls that so?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.530
No, it's not. This one has Japanese songs.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.740
By the way, earlier today Ms. Yoshinoya
appeared after you left,

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.200
and revealed a shocking fact.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.990
A shocking fact?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:18.080
Oh my, it has many more accessories.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.920
It looked simpler when I made it.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.300
According to her...

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:26.630
Originally, the statue looked like this.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:31.970
Rain and wind changed its shape
over the course of time.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.890
That's what makes sculptures fascinating.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:40.060
Over the course of time? But that looks
nothing like what it is now.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:45.480
Apparently, she made it while she was a
student. It was pointless to pray to it after all.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:49.650
It's changed shape that much?
How old is she?

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:55.450
That's not all. I saw something after class.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.790
l don't know what it is, but here comes
the shocking fact part two!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.290
What did you see?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.000
l saw Sae praying to Yamabuki Jizo.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:04.710
She did?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.260
She wants a reward in secret.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.800
Huh?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.640
Ms. Yoshinoya?!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.850
Hey, I saw Ms. Yoshinoya in Booth 404.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.690
Did you know that Ms. Yoshinoya
made Yamabuki Jizo?

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.650
Um, yeah. Besides, aren't you surprised?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.940
Wow!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.360
Too late.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.030
Ms. Yoshinoya seems to come here often.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.160
l saw her when you couldn't come
because of the deadline.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:41.920
Didn't you say you didn't know much
about Yamabuki Jizo earlier today?

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.170
Well, um...

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.500
Yeah, I think you said you only knew its name.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:54.180
But you also knew it was sculpted
by Ms. Yoshinoya. But how?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:16:01.350
Wait... So, Sae knew it was
Ms. Yoshinoya's art work, but...

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:06.060
A question! The shocking fact part three.

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:08.730
Why did you pray to it even though
you know it was just hers?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.530
Um...

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:15.530
Oh damn! Okay, I'll tell you.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.370
l lied that I didn't know. Sorry.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:25.500
There is a rumor among some students
about Yamabuki Jizo.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:31.720
Because it was made by Ms. Yoshinoya,
your chest might get bigger by praying to it.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.590
Bouncy, bouncy!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:38.890
